{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12441","headline":"暇日览旧诗因以题咏 · 钱起","name":"暇日览旧诗因以题咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逍遥心地得关关，偶被功名涴我闲。\n有寿亦将归象外，无诗兼不恋人间。\n何穷默识轻洪范，未丧斯文胜大还。\n筐箧静开难似此，蕊珠春色海中山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12441.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12441","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}